WEBVTT

01:35.850 --> 01:40.860
[Fated Hearts]

01:41.440 --> 01:44.030
[Episode 29]

01:53.070 --> 01:55.270
How long do you plan to keep me locked up?

01:56.150 --> 01:58.210
What do you want to do when you get out?

01:58.310 --> 02:00.310
Go back to Susha to find your father?

02:01.070 --> 02:02.920
I've already divorced Xia Jingshi.

02:02.920 --> 02:04.120
Your Majesty, please send a message

02:04.120 --> 02:05.710
to inform my father and brother that

02:05.710 --> 02:07.040
the marriage alliance between
our two kingdoms has been annulled

02:07.040 --> 02:08.840
and that I will return home soon.

02:09.000 --> 02:09.630
This time,

02:10.360 --> 02:11.800
I truly want to help you.

02:12.560 --> 02:14.240
But I really can't.

02:16.630 --> 02:17.360
Right.

02:17.840 --> 02:19.640
Why would I expect you to help me?

02:20.120 --> 02:20.960
You're the one who

02:20.960 --> 02:22.090
imprisoned me here.

02:22.560 --> 02:24.560
It's not that I don't want to help you.

02:24.560 --> 02:25.280
I just can't

02:25.280 --> 02:26.940
deliver messages to the dead.

02:28.520 --> 02:29.450
What did you say?

02:29.680 --> 02:30.960
You heard me correctly.

02:30.960 --> 02:32.560
Your father and your brother

02:32.590 --> 02:33.780
are both dead.

02:33.960 --> 02:35.840
Your father and brother are dead!

02:41.120 --> 02:42.940
My father died long ago.

02:43.120 --> 02:44.840
And I wish my brother

02:45.079 --> 02:46.079
would die sooner!

02:46.680 --> 02:47.410
Xia Jingyan.

02:47.800 --> 02:48.400
If you have nothing to say,

02:48.400 --> 02:49.400
then don't speak.

02:50.000 --> 02:50.960
If you keep talking nonsense,

02:50.960 --> 02:52.960
don't blame me for being rude to you.

02:53.710 --> 02:55.440
I knew you wouldn't believe me.

02:56.240 --> 02:57.000
This is an urgent report

02:57.000 --> 02:58.200
from our spy in Susha.

02:59.520 --> 03:00.920
Take a look for yourself.

03:02.720 --> 03:03.420
[Prime Minister Zhuang Shen of Susha
has died. The First Prince, Feng Suige,]

03:03.450 --> 03:03.940
[tried to kill the emperor
and seize the throne.]

03:03.940 --> 03:04.430
[Feng Pingcheng,
the Emperor of Susha Kingdom, is dead.]

03:04.460 --> 03:05.180
[Feng Suige was executed.]

03:15.240 --> 03:16.240
It's fake, right?

03:17.030 --> 03:17.870
Xia Jingyan,

03:18.840 --> 03:20.000
to mess with me,

03:21.079 --> 03:22.150
you actually wrote something like this

03:22.150 --> 03:22.840
to scare me?

03:25.280 --> 03:26.400
If I'd known this could really

03:26.400 --> 03:27.300
scare you,

03:27.400 --> 03:28.930
I would've done it long ago.

03:29.680 --> 03:31.540
Why didn't I think of this before?

03:51.310 --> 03:52.510
Do you believe it now?

03:54.190 --> 03:54.750
No.

03:57.000 --> 03:58.430
Looks like you do.

04:16.740 --> 04:18.810
♪ Flying alone ♪

04:17.720 --> 04:18.320
Move!

04:18.870 --> 04:19.700
No need to chase her.

04:19.579 --> 04:21.959
♪ With no need for direction ♪

04:20.510 --> 04:21.540
I'm going back!

04:21.630 --> 04:22.960
I'm going back to Susha!

04:24.660 --> 04:26.600
♪ Flying up to the clouds ♪

04:27.440 --> 04:29.610
♪ Yet the sun is hiding ♪

04:28.830 --> 04:30.460
None of you can fool me.

04:31.720 --> 04:33.550
My father and brother are fine.

04:32.610 --> 04:33.980
♪ Roaming freely ♪

04:33.600 --> 04:35.280
None of you can deceive me.

04:34.480 --> 04:37.570
♪ Unafraid of wind or frost ♪

04:39.800 --> 04:41.500
♪ The wet wings ♪

04:41.750 --> 04:45.260
♪ Will carry me far away ♪

04:49.270 --> 04:52.409
♪ Don't cry, don't cry ♪

04:50.390 --> 04:52.360
I'm going back to Susha!

04:52.600 --> 04:54.510
I'm going home!

04:55.420 --> 04:59.280
♪ I'll remember the way home ♪

04:55.430 --> 04:57.430
I'm going home!

04:58.270 --> 04:59.360
I'm going home!

05:04.450 --> 05:07.530
♪ Don't cry, don't cry ♪

05:10.200 --> 05:15.050
♪ I'll find the way home ♪

05:22.760 --> 05:23.890
Going back to Susha?

05:24.040 --> 05:25.240
So what if you go back?

05:25.630 --> 05:26.190
Is there still a place for you

05:26.190 --> 05:27.240
in Susha?

05:28.240 --> 05:29.840
Your father is already dead.

05:30.430 --> 05:31.270
And your brother is

05:31.270 --> 05:34.470
a criminal who killed the emperor
and usurped the throne.

05:39.480 --> 05:40.880
You don't want to hear it?

05:41.120 --> 05:42.560
That just makes me
want to say it even more.

05:42.560 --> 05:45.020
You chose to betray Susha
in the first place.

05:45.120 --> 05:46.780
You chose to save Xia Jingshi.

05:46.870 --> 05:47.830
Anyone who gets involved with Xia Jingshi

05:47.830 --> 05:49.230
never ends well.

05:49.390 --> 05:50.450
He deserves to die.

05:50.510 --> 05:52.190
And you—for being heartbroken over him—

05:52.190 --> 05:53.590
you deserve it even more.

05:55.840 --> 05:56.690
Feng Xiyang,

05:57.270 --> 05:58.670
you have no home anymore.

05:59.520 --> 06:00.850
You have no family left.

06:01.190 --> 06:02.160
You're just a wandering ghost

06:02.160 --> 06:04.680
with nowhere to belong.

06:04.870 --> 06:05.480
This is

06:05.480 --> 06:07.070
your punishment for marrying Xia Jingshi.

06:06.420 --> 06:09.960
♪ Don't cry, don't cry ♪

06:12.360 --> 06:16.650
♪ I'll remember the way home ♪

06:12.560 --> 06:13.560
Remember.

06:14.480 --> 06:16.410
Remember the taste of these tears.

06:17.830 --> 06:19.630
That's the taste of your punishment.

06:19.630 --> 06:21.240
Never forget it for the rest of your life.

06:21.100 --> 06:25.580
♪ Don't cry, don't cry ♪

06:27.320 --> 06:32.710
♪ I'll find the way home ♪

06:29.040 --> 06:29.630
Look!

06:30.070 --> 06:30.880
Look!

06:32.190 --> 06:33.510
There's one more person in this world

06:33.510 --> 06:34.770
who hates Xia Jingshi!

06:35.909 --> 06:40.480
♪ Don't cry, don't cry ♪

06:42.159 --> 06:47.120
♪ I'll remember the way home ♪

06:42.720 --> 06:43.750
Mention my father and my brother again

06:43.750 --> 06:45.040
and see what happens!

06:51.100 --> 06:55.760
♪ Don't cry, don't cry ♪

06:56.310 --> 06:57.409
Take her back to the Mirror Room!

06:57.320 --> 07:02.690
♪ I'll find the way home ♪

06:57.630 --> 06:58.159
Yes!

07:04.800 --> 07:06.040
Let go of me!

07:04.980 --> 07:12.630
♪ I'll find the way home ♪

07:08.510 --> 07:09.600
Let go of me!

07:20.800 --> 07:22.530
Is Feng Pingcheng really dead?

07:22.720 --> 07:23.120
Yes.

07:23.480 --> 07:25.190
The news has spread throughout the palace.

07:25.190 --> 07:26.480
I secretly looked into it.

07:26.480 --> 07:28.510
Feng Suige killed his father
and emperor.

07:28.510 --> 07:30.160
Feng Pingcheng died on the spot,

07:30.160 --> 07:30.960
and Feng Suige

07:31.040 --> 07:32.950
was executed by the Murong family.

07:32.950 --> 07:33.760
Impossible.

07:34.720 --> 07:36.380
From what I know of Feng Suige,

07:36.430 --> 07:37.510
he would never commit

07:37.510 --> 07:38.550
patricide.

07:39.190 --> 07:40.120
Who is currently

07:41.070 --> 07:42.260
ruling Susha?

07:42.390 --> 07:43.790
Murong Zhong and his son.

07:44.390 --> 07:45.920
That explains everything.

07:46.310 --> 07:47.000
I bet

07:47.430 --> 07:49.250
Feng Suige and Feng Pingcheng

07:49.360 --> 07:50.480
were both killed

07:50.560 --> 07:52.190
by the Murong Zhong and his son,

07:52.190 --> 07:53.140
and Feng Suige was then framed

07:53.140 --> 07:54.240
for patricide.

07:55.990 --> 07:57.050
What about Yixiao?

07:57.190 --> 07:58.520
Is there any news of her?

07:59.110 --> 07:59.900
Not yet.

08:01.390 --> 08:02.680
Keep sending people to look.

08:02.680 --> 08:03.680
As soon as there's any news,

08:03.680 --> 08:04.950
come back and inform me immediately.

08:04.950 --> 08:05.480
Yes.

08:09.200 --> 08:11.130
Susha is now in such great turmoil.

08:12.720 --> 08:14.720
It's busy dealing with its own mess.

08:15.630 --> 08:17.630
They won't start a war anytime soon.

08:18.560 --> 08:19.610
Which means,

08:19.950 --> 08:21.350
with the borders stable,

08:22.750 --> 08:25.750
the Empress Dowager and her son
have no more use for me.

08:26.120 --> 08:27.980
Your Highness, are you saying...

08:29.510 --> 08:30.920
Xia Jingyan will do everything

08:30.920 --> 08:31.780
to get rid of me.

08:33.950 --> 08:35.480
We need to speed up our plan.

08:37.270 --> 08:38.919
How's the task

08:39.120 --> 08:40.000
I gave Bai Shouzhuo going?

08:40.000 --> 08:41.600
Everyone you asked for has been contacted.

08:41.600 --> 08:43.530
They're waiting for your command.

08:46.000 --> 08:46.670
Tonight,

08:47.440 --> 08:48.480
I'll meet with our people

08:48.480 --> 08:49.360
myself

08:50.840 --> 08:52.750
and plan the next step.

09:06.180 --> 09:08.380
We'll be there once we cross this river.

09:08.910 --> 09:10.040
How do we get across?

09:10.510 --> 09:11.320
Swim?

09:13.750 --> 09:15.210
There's a boat over there.

09:15.720 --> 09:16.250
Let's go.

09:24.390 --> 09:25.160
Nobody move!

09:25.600 --> 09:26.600
We're on the same side.

09:26.600 --> 09:28.800
We know people from the Storm Alliance.

09:31.970 --> 09:34.740
[Zhang Dongshi,
Elder of Fishing Branch, Storm Alliance]

09:32.030 --> 09:33.220
Who exactly are you?

09:33.830 --> 09:35.360
How did you find this place?

09:38.270 --> 09:38.790
Girl,

09:39.030 --> 09:39.720
it's me!

09:42.630 --> 09:50.050
[Wufeng Mountain, Storm Alliance]

10:15.270 --> 10:16.030
Ning Fei,

10:16.320 --> 10:17.720
have some water and rest.

10:20.790 --> 10:21.740
Ning Fei.

10:23.320 --> 10:24.370
[Shennong's Materia Medica]

10:27.360 --> 10:28.030
I'm sorry.

10:29.770 --> 10:31.300
I'm sorry. I didn't mean to.

10:37.570 --> 10:39.370
You should stop caring about me.

10:41.600 --> 10:42.430
Ning Fei,

10:42.670 --> 10:43.320
I came to the Storm Alliance

10:43.320 --> 10:44.780
specifically to find you.

10:44.830 --> 10:46.390
Although your physical wounds have healed,

10:46.390 --> 10:48.030
your emotional wounds haven't.

10:48.030 --> 10:48.950
No matter what,

10:49.240 --> 10:49.840
I need to

10:49.840 --> 10:51.040
heal you completely.

10:58.850 --> 10:59.850
Elder Zhou.

11:00.650 --> 11:02.080
You saved Ning Fei's life.

11:02.080 --> 11:02.870
But he's been

11:02.210 --> 11:04.280
[Shennong's Materia Medica]

11:02.870 --> 11:04.550
so melancholy. How can that be?

11:04.550 --> 11:06.190
Could you please help me talk to him?

11:06.190 --> 11:08.010
[Shennong's Materia Medica]

11:08.880 --> 11:12.500
[Zhou Hao,
Elder of Studying Branch, Storm Alliance]

11:09.960 --> 11:11.240
Heaven, earth, and all things

11:11.240 --> 11:12.480
are the same.

11:13.480 --> 11:14.600
Whether he should feel joy or sorrow

11:14.600 --> 11:15.800
should not be forced.

11:15.960 --> 11:17.720
Just let him follow his heart.

11:21.240 --> 11:21.940
Elder Zhou,

11:22.200 --> 11:23.240
Lord Ling brought a patient here.

11:23.240 --> 11:24.080
The situation is serious.

11:24.080 --> 11:25.360
He's been placed in the treatment room.

11:25.360 --> 11:26.960
Alright, I'll go take a look.

11:27.200 --> 11:27.920
Elder Feng,

11:28.030 --> 11:29.390
are my father and the others here?

11:29.390 --> 11:29.790
Yes.

11:29.840 --> 11:31.270
He's in the treatment room.

11:31.270 --> 11:31.870
Ning Fei,

11:32.000 --> 11:33.000
my father is here.

11:33.440 --> 11:33.840
Come.

11:34.030 --> 11:34.550
I'll take you to meet

11:34.550 --> 11:36.280
the person who saved your life.

11:36.840 --> 11:37.370
Let's go.

12:03.440 --> 12:04.270
Lord Ling,

12:04.600 --> 12:06.600
you said he wouldn't last five days.

12:06.630 --> 12:07.630
How is he now?

12:08.200 --> 12:08.930
Don't worry.

12:09.480 --> 12:10.390
Elder Zhou of the Storm Alliance

12:10.390 --> 12:11.840
practices medicine differently from me.

12:11.840 --> 12:12.870
His methods are unorthodox.

12:12.870 --> 12:14.800
He'll surely find a way to save him.

12:31.120 --> 12:31.580
Father!

12:33.200 --> 12:33.910
Sister.

12:33.960 --> 12:35.150
Elder Zhou, the patient is here.

12:35.150 --> 12:36.680
Alright, let me take a look.

12:40.500 --> 12:41.350
Yixiao?

12:41.910 --> 12:42.510
Ning Fei.

12:47.650 --> 12:48.720
Feng Suige?

12:54.510 --> 12:55.810
He is Feng Suige?

12:55.910 --> 12:57.270
He's Feng Pingcheng's son, right?

12:57.270 --> 12:57.630
Girl.

12:57.630 --> 12:58.890
-I'll kill him!
-Girl!

12:59.000 --> 12:59.940
Calm down.

13:00.030 --> 13:01.100
Let me explain.

13:01.320 --> 13:02.700
Let me explain!

13:03.510 --> 13:11.200
[Storm Alliance]

13:05.510 --> 13:06.270
Why did you stop me

13:06.270 --> 13:07.550
from killing Feng Suige?

13:07.550 --> 13:08.630
For such a serious matter,

13:08.630 --> 13:10.320
we should wait for Elder Lei's approval.

13:10.320 --> 13:11.320
I brought him here.

13:11.320 --> 13:12.030
If you don't save him,

13:11.930 --> 13:15.220
[Lei Lie, Elder of Woodcutting Branch,
Storm Alliance]

13:12.080 --> 13:13.150
I must take him away.

13:13.150 --> 13:14.480
Don't waste your words.

13:17.840 --> 13:18.670
Lord Ling,

13:19.200 --> 13:19.960
I understand

13:20.550 --> 13:21.750
everything you said.

13:22.510 --> 13:23.770
Since you understand,

13:26.030 --> 13:27.360
will you save him or not?

13:31.270 --> 13:32.960
Why did you ask
when you already know the answer?

13:32.960 --> 13:34.150
Back then, Feng Pingcheng sent troops

13:34.150 --> 13:35.200
to wipe out the Storm Alliance.

13:35.200 --> 13:36.930
We suffered heavy casualties.

13:37.200 --> 13:39.670
The Storm Alliance and the Feng family
are sworn enemies.

13:39.670 --> 13:41.030
Bringing a Feng descendant

13:41.030 --> 13:42.230
to the Storm Alliance

13:42.600 --> 13:44.020
is asking for death.

13:44.270 --> 13:44.960
But don't forget,

13:44.960 --> 13:45.600
Feng Suige is also

13:45.600 --> 13:46.510
Wei Qingyu's son.

13:46.510 --> 13:48.310
But he still bears the Feng name!

13:48.670 --> 13:49.550
Anyone from the Feng family

13:49.550 --> 13:50.480
is our Storm Alliance's

13:50.480 --> 13:51.410
mortal enemy.

13:52.080 --> 13:52.670
Elders,

13:54.080 --> 13:55.080
what do you think?

13:59.790 --> 14:01.390
I'll listen to my godfather.

14:01.670 --> 14:02.750
I'm a doctor.

14:02.840 --> 14:05.150
I don't want to stand by
and let someone die.

14:05.150 --> 14:06.120
Why don't you

14:06.150 --> 14:08.110
make the decision yourselves?

14:11.030 --> 14:14.120
Rules are rules.

14:15.150 --> 14:15.720
Fine.

14:16.150 --> 14:17.810
Today we'll follow the rules.

14:18.390 --> 14:19.850
The Fengs are our enemies.

14:20.080 --> 14:22.120
I'll kill Feng Suige for revenge!

14:23.240 --> 14:24.510
Storm Alliance was founded

14:23.600 --> 14:27.930
[Great Shelter Hall]

14:24.510 --> 14:25.240
by Feng Suige's mother.

14:25.240 --> 14:25.720
Everyone in the Alliance

14:25.720 --> 14:27.240
has benefited from her kindness.

14:27.240 --> 14:28.120
The current four elders are led

14:28.120 --> 14:30.070
by Lei Lie from the Woodcutting Branch.

14:30.070 --> 14:32.000
And Elder Lei hates the Fengs most.

14:32.360 --> 14:34.000
But for my father's sake,

14:34.120 --> 14:34.870
they shouldn't make things too hard

14:34.870 --> 14:36.280
for Feng Suige.

14:38.240 --> 14:39.750
Lord Ling once told me

14:39.790 --> 14:41.450
never to reveal his identity.

14:41.600 --> 14:44.150
I'm afraid
he can't resolve this matter either.

14:44.150 --> 14:44.890
I'll go in and take a look.

14:44.890 --> 14:46.850
[Great Shelter Hall]

14:48.120 --> 14:48.750
Ning Fei.

14:49.080 --> 14:49.860
You can't go.

14:50.200 --> 14:51.870
You're now a member of the Storm Alliance.

14:51.870 --> 14:53.530
You can't openly help Yixiao.

14:54.640 --> 14:56.530
[Great Shelter Hall]

14:55.120 --> 14:55.670
Stop!

14:55.910 --> 14:56.840
Get out of my way.

14:57.600 --> 14:58.860
I failed Yixiao.

15:00.390 --> 15:01.080
If you kill him,

15:01.080 --> 15:01.630
after you die,

15:01.630 --> 15:02.870
how will you face Qingyu?

15:02.870 --> 15:03.480
You can't enter!

15:03.480 --> 15:04.410
You cannot go in!

15:09.240 --> 15:10.200
Feng Suige's mother

15:10.200 --> 15:12.130
once showed kindness to all of you.

15:12.150 --> 15:14.080
Now her son's life is hanging by a thread.

15:14.080 --> 15:15.120
Not only do you refuse to save him,

15:15.120 --> 15:16.630
but you also want to kill him.

15:16.630 --> 15:18.440
Isn't this
repaying kindness with betrayal?

15:18.440 --> 15:19.440
Years ago, Feng Pingcheng

15:19.440 --> 15:21.720
killed Qingyu despite their marriage bond,

15:21.720 --> 15:22.360
then sent troops

15:22.360 --> 15:23.910
to wipe out our Storm Alliance.

15:23.910 --> 15:24.840
That blood debt

15:25.390 --> 15:26.670
falls on Feng Suige.

15:27.240 --> 15:28.840
A son paying for his father's sins

15:28.840 --> 15:29.770
is only natural.

15:30.030 --> 15:31.390
You probably don't know

15:31.960 --> 15:33.030
the full truth.

15:33.840 --> 15:34.980
Feng Suige's mother

15:35.080 --> 15:36.390
was killed by Susha's Prime Minister,

15:36.390 --> 15:37.200
Zhuang Shen.

15:43.550 --> 15:44.730
How do you know this?

15:45.200 --> 15:46.360
I heard it with my own ears,

15:46.360 --> 15:47.480
witnessed it with my own eyes,

15:47.480 --> 15:48.510
and personally helped Feng Suige

15:48.510 --> 15:49.710
capture Zhuang Shen.

15:50.320 --> 15:51.650
Everyone in Susha knows

15:51.720 --> 15:52.870
that the First Prince Feng Suige

15:52.870 --> 15:54.070
executed Zhuang Shen

15:54.200 --> 15:55.930
and cleared his mother's name.

15:56.600 --> 15:58.560
Feng Suige avenged his mother.

15:59.150 --> 15:59.720
And you elders

15:59.720 --> 16:00.840
of the Storm Alliance—

16:00.840 --> 16:02.370
not only did you do nothing,

16:02.480 --> 16:05.120
you didn't even figure out
who your true enemy was.

16:05.120 --> 16:05.880
Regardless,

16:05.960 --> 16:07.670
he is still Feng Pingcheng's son.

16:07.670 --> 16:08.480
He has the Feng family blood

16:08.480 --> 16:09.680
flowing in his veins.

16:10.120 --> 16:10.950
Are you sure

16:11.630 --> 16:12.750
it was Feng Pingcheng who ordered

16:12.750 --> 16:14.610
the attack on the Storm Alliance?

16:14.790 --> 16:16.390
I heard him myself say

16:16.840 --> 16:18.030
he never took your Storm Alliance

16:18.030 --> 16:18.850
seriously.

16:19.030 --> 16:20.200
If he had truly decided

16:20.200 --> 16:21.860
to wipe out the Storm Alliance

16:21.870 --> 16:22.950
and sent his army,

16:23.080 --> 16:24.880
none of you would be alive today.

16:25.120 --> 16:25.770
Tell me—

16:26.120 --> 16:27.030
Feng Suige's mother

16:27.030 --> 16:28.490
was killed by Zhuang Shen,

16:29.150 --> 16:30.200
so who is it

16:30.870 --> 16:32.240
that fears your secret revenge

16:32.240 --> 16:33.360
and wants to wipe out
the Storm Alliance completely?

16:33.360 --> 16:34.030
Nonsense!

16:34.360 --> 16:35.600
You're just making up lies

16:35.600 --> 16:36.870
to save Feng Suige!

16:37.000 --> 16:38.260
Enough. Stop arguing.

16:39.440 --> 16:40.440
Allow me a moment

16:41.480 --> 16:43.140
to weigh whether this is true.

16:43.440 --> 16:46.320
Keep Feng Suige under guard for now.

16:46.870 --> 16:47.670
Elder Lei,

16:48.270 --> 16:49.870
you cannot be soft-hearted.

16:50.750 --> 16:52.210
Since Big Brother said so,

16:52.390 --> 16:53.450
let's think it over

16:53.480 --> 16:54.940
before making a decision.

16:56.270 --> 16:57.470
I'll make this clear:

16:58.480 --> 16:59.880
if you want to kill Suige,

17:00.200 --> 17:01.800
you'll have to kill me first.

17:07.270 --> 17:08.400
I'll go check on him.

17:08.829 --> 17:09.480
Zhou Hao!

17:10.880 --> 17:11.880
If you dare try

17:11.880 --> 17:13.390
to save Feng Suige,

17:14.589 --> 17:16.790
don't blame me for being harsh with you.

17:19.930 --> 17:22.630
[Storm Alliance]

17:34.070 --> 17:34.600
How is he?

17:34.960 --> 17:36.560
Is there any way to treat him?

17:37.070 --> 17:38.670
I'm just here to check on him.

17:38.820 --> 17:40.640
Those three elders haven't agreed,

17:40.640 --> 17:42.200
so I can't treat him.

17:50.680 --> 17:51.540
Sifang Elixir?

17:52.030 --> 17:53.230
Zhou, what are you...

17:53.830 --> 17:54.830
Keep quiet.

17:56.200 --> 17:58.760
Feng Suige's condition doesn't look good.

17:59.070 --> 18:00.910
Put this under his tongue.

18:01.160 --> 18:02.310
It will help him hold on
for a few more days.

18:02.310 --> 18:02.960
Hurry.

18:13.590 --> 18:14.850
Thank you, Elder Zhou.

18:15.120 --> 18:16.030
Elder Zhou,

18:16.110 --> 18:17.270
can you find any way

18:17.270 --> 18:18.110
to make an exception?

18:18.110 --> 18:18.960
I'll do anything

18:18.960 --> 18:20.420
as long as you can save him.

18:21.880 --> 18:23.320
I want to save him too.

18:23.830 --> 18:25.000
I'm alone

18:25.070 --> 18:25.880
and none of my family

18:25.880 --> 18:27.030
died in that siege,

18:27.480 --> 18:28.400
but Elder Lei

18:28.510 --> 18:29.370
and Elder Zhang

18:29.400 --> 18:30.750
watched

18:30.750 --> 18:31.480
their children

18:31.480 --> 18:32.640
die in that siege.

18:32.720 --> 18:34.400
Their hatred of the Feng family

18:34.400 --> 18:36.000
runs too deep.

18:38.160 --> 18:39.720
Reconciling that hatred

18:41.270 --> 18:42.930
will be extremely difficult.

18:44.640 --> 18:45.240
Zhou.

18:47.070 --> 18:49.400
I'll go to your place
to get some medicine.

18:49.510 --> 18:50.170
Help me out.

18:59.000 --> 18:59.750
Sister.

19:00.720 --> 19:02.520
Although Ning Fei didn't say it,

19:02.960 --> 19:03.880
I know in his heart

19:03.880 --> 19:05.280
he must feel very guilty.

19:06.510 --> 19:07.710
What happened to him?

19:08.350 --> 19:10.880
He seems like
a completely different person.

19:13.960 --> 19:14.880
It was Elder Zhou

19:14.880 --> 19:16.480
who saved Ning Fei back then.

19:16.680 --> 19:17.440
When he woke up,

19:17.440 --> 19:19.030
he even asked why he bothered saving him,

19:19.030 --> 19:20.920
saying it would've been better
to let him die.

19:20.920 --> 19:21.750
Later, Elder Feng

19:21.750 --> 19:23.610
took him into the Farming Branch.

19:23.750 --> 19:25.510
Every day, apart from working the fields,

19:25.510 --> 19:26.710
he just sits in a daze,

19:27.030 --> 19:28.360
hardly speaking a word.

19:34.240 --> 19:35.210
He believes that

19:35.480 --> 19:36.590
since his brothers,

19:36.590 --> 19:37.350
his Jinxiu,

19:37.350 --> 19:38.350
his prince,

19:38.750 --> 19:40.270
and everything he believed in
and stood for

19:40.270 --> 19:41.310
are all gone,

19:42.240 --> 19:43.640
he might as well be dead.

19:50.890 --> 19:51.590
Once Feng Suige

19:51.590 --> 19:53.120
pulls through this ordeal,

19:53.480 --> 19:55.480
I'll try to talk some sense into him.

19:55.750 --> 19:56.350
Alright.

20:00.390 --> 20:02.650
[Cuiwei Palace]

20:08.510 --> 20:10.040
Greetings, Your Eminence.

20:16.000 --> 20:18.200
When I received your secret message,

20:18.590 --> 20:19.830
I gathered them here

20:19.850 --> 20:20.930
to await your arrival.

20:20.670 --> 20:22.220
[Xunzi]

20:23.990 --> 20:25.550
[The palace lantern appeared.
Let's meet up at Cuiwei Palace]

20:25.930 --> 20:26.250
[Xunzi]

20:26.870 --> 20:29.310
[The palace lantern appeared.
Let's meet up at Cuiwei Palace]

20:30.680 --> 20:33.400
You've been hiding in the palace
for so many years.

20:33.400 --> 20:35.060
You've all suffered greatly.

20:35.070 --> 20:36.520
Heaven shows no mercy,

20:36.880 --> 20:38.280
and darkness draws near.

20:38.720 --> 20:39.770
Only you

20:40.200 --> 20:41.730
can save all living beings.

20:42.680 --> 20:44.610
The moment we heard of your return,

20:45.070 --> 20:46.850
we've been ready

20:46.920 --> 20:48.180
to meet you at any time.

20:48.200 --> 20:49.060
Your Eminence,

20:49.440 --> 20:50.520
is our great cause

20:50.750 --> 20:51.650
about to begin?

20:52.270 --> 20:53.830
Are you all ready?

20:54.640 --> 20:56.170
Just give the order,

20:57.590 --> 20:59.790
and we will give our lives
without hesitation.

20:59.790 --> 21:01.030
What if I order you

21:02.110 --> 21:03.970
to kill the Emperor, Xia Jingyan?

21:08.550 --> 21:09.110
What?

21:10.030 --> 21:10.920
Are you afraid?

21:16.960 --> 21:18.290
Your Eminence, for you,

21:18.480 --> 21:20.340
we would die without hesitation.

21:33.750 --> 21:35.820
♪ Flying alone ♪

21:36.260 --> 21:39.210
♪ With no need for direction ♪

21:41.680 --> 21:43.500
♪ Flying up to the clouds ♪

21:43.480 --> 21:44.400
On the wedding day,

21:44.100 --> 21:46.570
♪ Yet the sun is hiding ♪

21:44.510 --> 21:47.040
I'll wear the ones
my father bestowed upon me.

21:47.110 --> 21:47.880
Not because

21:47.880 --> 21:49.180
they're priceless,

21:49.210 --> 21:51.030
♪ Roaming freely ♪

21:49.440 --> 21:50.000
but because

21:50.000 --> 21:51.700
they carry his love—

21:51.450 --> 21:54.580
♪ Unafraid of wind or frost ♪

21:51.880 --> 21:54.080
that's what makes them truly precious.

21:56.540 --> 21:58.430
♪ The wet wings ♪

21:58.760 --> 22:02.170
♪ Will carry me far away ♪

22:05.270 --> 22:06.160
Don't come over!

22:06.000 --> 22:09.460
♪ Don't cry, don't cry ♪

22:06.350 --> 22:06.880
Xiyang!

22:07.000 --> 22:07.830
Put down the knife!

22:07.830 --> 22:08.440
Leave!

22:08.590 --> 22:10.400
Or I swear I'll die right here!

22:12.330 --> 22:16.430
♪ I'll remember the way home ♪

22:16.090 --> 22:18.020
There's no turning back from here.

22:18.160 --> 22:19.220
If you want to stay,

22:19.350 --> 22:20.750
get off the carriage now.

22:20.970 --> 22:22.410
There's no turning back for me now.

22:21.060 --> 22:24.480
♪ Don't cry, don't cry ♪

22:23.480 --> 22:24.590
Wherever you go,

22:24.640 --> 22:25.840
that's where I'll be.

22:27.210 --> 22:32.050
♪ I'll find the way home ♪

22:45.750 --> 22:46.550
Don't cry.

22:47.110 --> 22:47.960
Don't cry!

22:48.790 --> 22:50.160
You are the daughter
of Susha's founding emperor,

22:50.160 --> 22:51.370
Feng Pingcheng.

22:51.640 --> 22:52.720
You are the sister
of the Killer God of Susha,

22:52.720 --> 22:53.750
Feng Suige.

22:54.070 --> 22:55.950
You are the last bloodline
of the Feng family.

22:54.640 --> 22:59.310
♪ Don't cry, don't cry ♪

22:56.400 --> 22:58.240
You must not fall here.

23:00.000 --> 23:01.750
You must avenge them.

23:00.960 --> 23:06.820
♪ I'll find the way home ♪

23:08.660 --> 23:16.360
♪ I'll find the way home ♪

23:49.880 --> 23:50.400
Girl.

23:51.310 --> 23:52.240
Go back and rest.

23:52.640 --> 23:54.370
You mustn't exhaust yourself.

23:56.480 --> 23:57.260
I'm fine.

23:57.970 --> 23:58.930
I can hold on.

24:00.070 --> 24:00.920
Right now,

24:01.400 --> 24:02.590
I just want to find a way
to get the elders

24:02.590 --> 24:04.070
of the Storm Alliance to agree to save him

24:04.070 --> 24:05.400
as quickly as possible.

24:07.590 --> 24:08.200
Lord Ling,

24:08.680 --> 24:09.310
you must know about

24:09.310 --> 24:10.960
the situation
of the Storm Alliance, right?

24:10.960 --> 24:12.290
Please tell me about it.

24:13.000 --> 24:14.070
Feng Suige has never

24:14.070 --> 24:15.110
told me about it.

24:17.720 --> 24:18.640
When his mother founded

24:18.640 --> 24:20.840
the Storm Alliance, he was still young.

24:21.370 --> 24:23.570
He doesn't know much about many things.

24:23.830 --> 24:24.440
Back then,

24:25.000 --> 24:27.500
Qingyu was helping Feng Pingcheng
fight for power.

24:27.500 --> 24:29.340
Once she was seriously injured.

24:30.160 --> 24:30.790
Feng Pingcheng

24:30.790 --> 24:31.960
brought her to Zhengnian Villa,

24:31.960 --> 24:33.160
asking me to save her.

24:33.830 --> 24:35.440
But before she fully recovered,

24:35.440 --> 24:38.070
Feng Pingcheng rushed back
to the battlefield.

24:38.070 --> 24:39.110
I spared no effort

24:39.110 --> 24:40.570
and finally saved Qingyu.

24:41.590 --> 24:42.510
I remember after she woke up,

24:42.510 --> 24:43.110
she told me

24:44.480 --> 24:46.400
she felt like she had died once,

24:47.000 --> 24:49.240
and that many of the things
she had once clung to

24:49.240 --> 24:50.680
no longer mattered.

24:51.310 --> 24:52.880
I feel as if I have died once.

24:53.790 --> 24:55.310
Only after walking through hell

24:55.310 --> 24:56.570
did I truly understand

24:57.510 --> 24:58.750
how precious life is.

25:02.270 --> 25:04.000
I can understand that feeling.

25:05.110 --> 25:06.830
When I fell off the cliff,

25:07.720 --> 25:09.450
it felt like I had died once too.

25:09.720 --> 25:10.640
You and Qingyu

25:11.000 --> 25:13.330
are both brave and resourceful heroines,

25:13.640 --> 25:14.680
with great abilities

25:14.680 --> 25:15.680
but not arrogant.

25:15.830 --> 25:17.760
And both of you are compassionate.

25:20.650 --> 25:22.050
After Qingyu recovered,

25:22.640 --> 25:24.000
she grew weary of war

25:24.830 --> 25:26.960
and stayed at Zhengnian Villa to help.

25:26.980 --> 25:28.400
And in doing so,

25:28.400 --> 25:29.640
she saw much of the suffering

25:29.640 --> 25:30.830
caused by war.

25:34.310 --> 25:35.790
Mom!

25:39.960 --> 25:40.550
Zhengnian Villa

25:40.550 --> 25:42.070
has its own rules.

25:42.550 --> 25:43.680
The wounded I take in

25:43.920 --> 25:44.770
are treated regardless of faction,

25:44.770 --> 25:46.270
and no fighting is allowed.

25:46.270 --> 25:47.750
So enemies who were killing each other

25:47.750 --> 25:49.410
on the battlefield yesterday

25:49.440 --> 25:50.800
must live

25:51.110 --> 25:52.070
peacefully

25:52.070 --> 25:53.090
in my villa today.

25:53.790 --> 25:56.070
The warriors fight
because they have no choice.

25:56.070 --> 25:57.240
No one likes war,

25:57.880 --> 25:58.660
and no one

25:59.070 --> 26:00.470
wants to suffer from war.

26:01.400 --> 26:03.200
If they can coexist peacefully,

26:03.540 --> 26:04.790
why wouldn't they?

26:06.030 --> 26:07.110
That was

26:07.720 --> 26:08.520
when Chief Wei

26:09.070 --> 26:10.720
had the idea
to establish the Storm Alliance?

26:10.720 --> 26:11.520
That's right.

26:11.990 --> 26:13.680
Qingyu realized that the warring sides

26:13.680 --> 26:15.200
could reconcile.

26:15.880 --> 26:16.480
She told me

26:16.480 --> 26:17.830
that although she couldn't stop the war

26:17.830 --> 26:18.890
single-handedly,

26:19.480 --> 26:20.750
at the very least she could treat

26:20.750 --> 26:22.070
the wounded and displaced,

26:22.070 --> 26:23.870
giving them a chance to survive.

26:25.200 --> 26:26.400
So the Storm Alliance

26:26.960 --> 26:28.310
was meant to be a utopia,

26:29.110 --> 26:30.550
where people could fish, farm, work,

26:30.550 --> 26:31.610
and study in peace.

26:32.790 --> 26:33.960
Exactly.

26:34.790 --> 26:36.160
But since Qingyu was gone,

26:36.160 --> 26:38.160
what has the Storm Alliance become?

26:38.160 --> 26:39.960
It's become filled with hatred—

26:41.240 --> 26:42.900
hatred toward the Feng family

26:43.070 --> 26:44.400
and Susha.

26:49.970 --> 26:55.990
[Storm Alliance]

26:50.960 --> 26:52.490
I feel as if I have died once.

26:53.270 --> 26:54.750
Only after walking through hell

26:54.750 --> 26:56.010
did I truly understand

26:57.110 --> 26:58.310
how precious life is.

26:59.610 --> 27:04.670
[Storm Alliance]

27:03.400 --> 27:04.750
With dark skies and stormy weather,

27:04.750 --> 27:06.410
the roosters keep on crowing.

27:06.920 --> 27:08.020
This place should be called

27:08.020 --> 27:09.150
the Storm Alliance.

27:15.780 --> 27:17.160
[Storm Alliance]

27:21.480 --> 27:22.740
Greetings, Elder Lei.

27:23.110 --> 27:24.270
I'm sorry for disturbing you

27:24.270 --> 27:25.730
with my late-night visit.

27:26.550 --> 27:28.590
You're here to plead for Feng Suige?

27:29.720 --> 27:30.520
You want to say

27:30.830 --> 27:33.240
that what happened back then
had nothing to do with the Fengs

27:33.240 --> 27:35.440
and to persuade me to let go of my grudge?

27:35.440 --> 27:37.500
Feng Suige didn't do anything wrong.

27:37.960 --> 27:39.350
He didn't choose

27:40.070 --> 27:41.800
to be the son of Feng Pingcheng.

27:41.880 --> 27:43.000
This is his fate.

27:44.070 --> 27:45.030
My two sons

27:45.070 --> 27:46.870
both died in the siege back then.

27:47.270 --> 27:48.530
What did they do wrong?

27:49.720 --> 27:52.000
Do the grudges of the previous generation

27:52.000 --> 27:52.790
really have to make

27:52.790 --> 27:53.440
this generation

27:53.440 --> 27:54.640
bear the full burden?

27:55.310 --> 27:56.440
I know exactly what kind of person

27:56.440 --> 27:57.960
Feng Pingcheng is.

27:58.680 --> 27:59.400
Not a single person in the Feng family

27:59.400 --> 28:00.550
is decent.

28:00.920 --> 28:03.070
Feng Suige is different from his father.

28:03.070 --> 28:04.400
If he were truly like Feng Pingcheng,

28:04.400 --> 28:05.510
obsessed with power,

28:05.510 --> 28:06.350
he would have already become

28:06.350 --> 28:07.880
the emperor of Susha by now.

28:07.880 --> 28:09.030
He has never harmed

28:09.030 --> 28:10.230
any innocent person.

28:11.240 --> 28:12.240
He shouldn't have to

28:12.240 --> 28:13.270
unjustly pay

28:13.590 --> 28:15.120
for faults that aren't his.

28:15.510 --> 28:17.590
I don't care what kind of person he is.

28:18.400 --> 28:19.310
I only know

28:20.070 --> 28:21.270
he is my enemy.

28:23.070 --> 28:29.440
[Storm Alliance]

28:23.160 --> 28:23.790
Elder Lei,

28:24.720 --> 28:25.480
why was

28:25.480 --> 28:27.030
the Storm Alliance founded
in the first place?

28:27.030 --> 28:28.590
Why was it called the Storm Alliance?

28:28.590 --> 28:30.320
What was its original purpose?

28:32.350 --> 28:33.810
What are you trying to say?

28:34.350 --> 28:36.280
I brought Feng Suige here back then

28:36.310 --> 28:38.040
because I held hope in my heart.

28:38.270 --> 28:38.750
I didn't know

28:38.750 --> 28:40.110
what kind of place this was.

28:40.110 --> 28:40.720
I only heard

28:40.720 --> 28:42.120
the name Storm Alliance,

28:42.680 --> 28:44.070
heard that there might be a chance

28:44.070 --> 28:45.270
to save Feng Suige,

28:45.400 --> 28:47.060
and came without hesitation.

28:47.590 --> 28:48.680
Shouldn't this

28:48.680 --> 28:49.510
be a paradise

28:49.680 --> 28:50.750
that shelters all and protects people

28:50.750 --> 28:51.920
from the storm?

28:55.680 --> 28:57.960
From now on,
this will be a place that shelters all

28:57.960 --> 28:59.960
and protects people from the storm.

29:02.350 --> 29:03.480
I heard that back then, Chief Wei

29:03.480 --> 29:05.010
founded the Storm Alliance

29:05.030 --> 29:06.890
to give those who were displaced,

29:07.200 --> 29:08.160
who could see

29:09.070 --> 29:10.480
no hope of survival,

29:10.920 --> 29:12.550
a place to settle again,

29:13.110 --> 29:14.200
a place where they could live
and work in peace

29:14.200 --> 29:15.200
in chaotic times.

29:15.880 --> 29:17.480
Although I've never met her,

29:17.480 --> 29:18.510
I admire her.

29:19.270 --> 29:19.920
Throughout my life,

29:19.920 --> 29:22.120
I've also experienced many hardships.

29:22.200 --> 29:24.110
It's precisely because
I've been caught in the rain

29:24.110 --> 29:25.510
that I can't bear to watch others

29:25.510 --> 29:27.440
struggle helplessly in the storm.

29:27.480 --> 29:28.240
If I have the ability

29:28.240 --> 29:29.700
to save someone in danger,

29:30.160 --> 29:32.000
I will do everything in my power to help.

29:32.000 --> 29:33.030
If Feng Suige's mother

29:33.030 --> 29:34.030
were still alive,

29:34.680 --> 29:35.350
I believe

29:36.350 --> 29:37.720
she would do the same.

29:39.720 --> 29:41.520
Those who bring warmth to others

29:41.960 --> 29:44.160
must not be left to freeze in the snow.

29:44.830 --> 29:45.960
Feng Suige's mother

29:46.200 --> 29:46.790
saved so many people

29:46.790 --> 29:48.270
through the Storm Alliance.

29:48.270 --> 29:49.000
Her son

29:49.440 --> 29:50.240
shouldn't have

29:50.240 --> 29:52.240
to lose his chance to live like this.

29:52.350 --> 29:52.960
I believe

29:53.920 --> 29:56.550
the original purpose
of founding the Storm Alliance

29:56.550 --> 29:57.680
was to let those

29:57.680 --> 29:59.480
suffering in the cold and hunger

29:59.680 --> 30:01.140
see light in the darkness—

30:01.310 --> 30:02.680
to give the homeless people

30:02.680 --> 30:03.640
hope

30:05.240 --> 30:06.680
and to help them survive.

30:31.350 --> 30:32.510
Without her,

30:33.790 --> 30:35.270
many of us

30:36.830 --> 30:38.230
wouldn't be alive today.

30:39.160 --> 30:39.880
So...

30:41.070 --> 30:43.800
are you saying you're willing to save
Feng Suige?

31:25.110 --> 31:26.200
Mention my father and my brother again

31:26.200 --> 31:27.680
and see what happens!

31:56.830 --> 31:57.630
Your Majesty.

32:02.240 --> 32:03.400
Do you want to die?

32:05.270 --> 32:05.880
Get out!

32:07.830 --> 32:08.480
Get out!

32:09.550 --> 32:10.610
All of you, get out!

32:19.030 --> 32:20.030
Stop right there!

32:20.270 --> 32:22.470
How dare you barge into Shengfu Palace?

32:24.350 --> 32:25.950
Who's causing trouble here?

32:26.720 --> 32:27.550
Your Majesty,

32:27.680 --> 32:29.880
the Princess of Zhennan
is trying to force her way in.

32:29.880 --> 32:30.610
Outrageous!

32:32.000 --> 32:32.720
Let her in.

32:34.450 --> 32:35.710
[Shengfu Hall]

32:40.030 --> 32:40.240
[Shengfu Hall]

32:47.440 --> 32:50.070
Princess of Zhennan
barging into Shengfu Palace?

32:50.070 --> 32:51.750
How dare you?

32:52.200 --> 32:52.920
I've already told you—

32:52.920 --> 32:54.450
I've divorced Xia Jingshi.

32:54.590 --> 32:55.960
I'm no longer Princess of Zhennan.

32:55.960 --> 32:57.620
Don't ever call me that again.

32:58.030 --> 33:00.070
Did you really divorce Xia Jingshi?

33:04.460 --> 33:05.260
Bai Shouzhuo.

33:05.690 --> 33:06.720
My useless brother

33:06.720 --> 33:07.980
was really abandoned?

33:15.880 --> 33:16.440
Good!

33:16.790 --> 33:17.990
This family disgrace

33:18.750 --> 33:20.350
must be spread far and wide.

33:21.200 --> 33:22.000
Got it?

33:22.680 --> 33:23.540
Yes.

33:23.960 --> 33:25.020
Ask him to leave us.

33:25.440 --> 33:27.040
I have something to tell you.

33:27.720 --> 33:28.750
Get out.

33:40.690 --> 33:42.490
You want to ask me for something?

33:43.880 --> 33:44.790
Let me guess.

33:45.270 --> 33:47.480
You want me to show mercy

33:47.880 --> 33:49.740
and let you return to Susha again?

33:50.160 --> 33:50.720
That's not the attitude

33:50.720 --> 33:51.880
of someone asking for a favor.

33:51.880 --> 33:53.540
You should at least kneel down

33:54.310 --> 33:55.270
and kowtow to me.

34:06.590 --> 34:07.470
Interesting.

34:07.790 --> 34:08.710
This is the first time

34:08.710 --> 34:11.110
I've seen someone ask for favors
like this.

34:15.030 --> 34:16.030
If you kill me,

34:16.710 --> 34:17.920
you won't survive either.

34:17.920 --> 34:19.190
You said that I'm a homeless,

34:19.190 --> 34:20.190
wandering ghost.

34:21.000 --> 34:22.760
Since I have no one left
to care about in this world,

34:22.760 --> 34:24.090
why should I fear death?

34:24.150 --> 34:24.880
Both my father and brother

34:24.880 --> 34:26.550
wanted to kill you when they were alive.

34:26.550 --> 34:27.610
Why don't I kill you

34:28.030 --> 34:28.670
to comfort

34:28.670 --> 34:30.070
their spirits in heaven?

34:31.850 --> 34:33.260
Are you so eager

34:33.510 --> 34:34.440
to go join your father

34:34.440 --> 34:35.360
and brother?

34:39.909 --> 34:41.030
I already know

34:41.190 --> 34:42.989
what it feels like to be slapped.

34:43.040 --> 34:44.159
I don't like it.

34:48.070 --> 34:48.630
It hurts!

34:48.670 --> 34:49.230
It hurts!

34:52.030 --> 34:53.560
Remember this feeling too.

34:55.320 --> 34:57.850
This is your retribution
for humiliating me!

35:06.840 --> 35:08.070
What a vengeful

35:08.070 --> 35:09.130
Princess of Susha.

35:10.400 --> 35:12.670
You're more interesting than I thought.

35:13.840 --> 35:14.840
My brother

35:14.840 --> 35:16.150
would never murder our father and emperor.

35:16.150 --> 35:17.520
Someone killed them.

35:17.840 --> 35:19.030
Find the killer who murdered

35:19.030 --> 35:20.290
my father and brother!

35:20.670 --> 35:21.800
Are you ordering me?

35:22.560 --> 35:24.070
Who do you think you are?

35:25.840 --> 35:27.170
Didn't anyone teach you

35:27.630 --> 35:28.440
that when you ask for help,

35:28.440 --> 35:29.320
you must pay a price?

35:29.320 --> 35:30.920
That's what fairness means.

35:30.960 --> 35:31.880
I can help you.

35:35.480 --> 35:36.880
But what can you offer me?

35:47.150 --> 35:48.350
As long as you help me,

35:51.800 --> 35:53.440
I'll promise you anything.

36:05.440 --> 36:06.000
What?

36:10.030 --> 36:10.630
Servants!

36:14.890 --> 36:15.690
Your Majesty.

36:15.840 --> 36:16.570
Investigate

36:17.190 --> 36:18.590
how Feng Pingcheng died.

36:18.630 --> 36:19.550
Within three days,

36:19.550 --> 36:21.000
you must uncover the truth.

36:21.000 --> 36:21.660
If you fail,

36:21.670 --> 36:22.920
I'll kill you all.

36:23.150 --> 36:23.670
Yes.

36:28.280 --> 36:29.410
Where have you been?

36:30.910 --> 36:33.070
[Yujian Pavilion]

36:33.920 --> 36:34.780
I'm asking you,

36:34.960 --> 36:35.920
Princess Xiyang.

36:35.920 --> 36:37.650
What does it have to do with you?

36:37.840 --> 36:39.150
I've already divorced you.

36:39.150 --> 36:40.070
The bond between us as husband and wife

36:40.070 --> 36:41.070
no longer exists.

36:41.760 --> 36:43.890
My affairs have nothing to do with you.

36:44.110 --> 36:44.920
Princess Xiyang.

36:44.920 --> 36:46.280
If you dare bother me again,

36:46.280 --> 36:47.480
I swear I'll kill you.

36:52.820 --> 36:57.820
[Yujian Pavilion]

36:53.510 --> 36:54.230
Forgive me.

36:58.280 --> 36:59.610
You must've heard about

37:00.950 --> 37:03.350
what happened in Yujing City, haven't you?

37:04.090 --> 37:06.090
You're here to kick me when I'm down?

37:07.550 --> 37:09.080
I'm just worried about you.

37:11.090 --> 37:12.370
Is there anything I can do to help you?

37:12.370 --> 37:13.320
Spare me

37:13.320 --> 37:14.630
your fake concern.

37:15.550 --> 37:17.360
You're not even worth my curses.

37:19.000 --> 37:20.000
Princess Xiyang,

37:20.760 --> 37:21.320
if you need

37:21.320 --> 37:22.280
any help from me,

37:22.590 --> 37:23.520
feel free to ask.

37:24.920 --> 37:25.510
Though

37:25.880 --> 37:26.760
we are no longer

37:26.760 --> 37:27.760
husband and wife,

37:28.230 --> 37:29.830
we're still acquaintances.

37:31.480 --> 37:32.510
I mean no harm.

37:33.360 --> 37:34.440
I only wish to help.

37:38.280 --> 37:39.360
Acquaintances?

37:41.710 --> 37:43.070
Do I really know you?

37:44.130 --> 37:45.920
Why is it that
the longer we were together,

37:45.920 --> 37:47.780
the more of a stranger you became?

37:49.230 --> 37:49.960
You're not

37:49.960 --> 37:50.760
the Prince of Zhennan

37:50.760 --> 37:52.090
I once fell in love with.

37:52.440 --> 37:54.170
We never truly knew each other.

37:58.110 --> 37:58.960
Besides,

37:58.960 --> 38:00.290
the Feng Xiyang you know

38:01.190 --> 38:02.230
is already dead.

38:04.800 --> 38:06.780
[Yujian Pavilion]

38:08.260 --> 38:10.330
♪ Flying alone ♪

38:10.650 --> 38:13.640
♪ With no need for direction ♪

38:16.100 --> 38:18.150
♪ Flying up to the clouds ♪

38:18.650 --> 38:21.130
♪ Yet the sun is hiding ♪

38:23.740 --> 38:25.450
♪ Roaming freely ♪

38:25.930 --> 38:29.100
♪ Unafraid of wind or frost ♪

38:31.130 --> 38:32.900
♪ The wet wings ♪

38:33.270 --> 38:37.630
♪ Will carry me far away ♪

38:38.600 --> 38:41.510
[Yujian Pavilion]

38:39.340 --> 38:45.580
♪ I'll find the way home ♪

38:49.190 --> 38:50.400
I've treated his external wounds.

38:50.400 --> 38:51.110
They're not serious.

38:51.110 --> 38:52.150
The biggest problem now

38:52.150 --> 38:53.550
is the blockage of his blood and qi.

38:53.550 --> 38:55.400
We can only try to stimulate
his heart meridian

38:55.400 --> 38:56.360
and see if it helps him

38:56.360 --> 38:57.280
regain consciousness.

38:57.280 --> 38:58.630
But I've already used acupuncture

38:58.630 --> 38:59.880
to stimulate his heart meridian.

38:59.880 --> 39:00.920
There was no improvement.

39:00.920 --> 39:02.400
Ordinary acupuncture won't work anymore.

39:02.400 --> 39:03.660
Look at his blood flow—

39:03.880 --> 39:05.000
it's like a frozen river,

39:05.000 --> 39:06.230
completely blocked.

39:06.550 --> 39:07.110
Come on.

39:07.440 --> 39:08.550
Pierce his finger to release blood

39:08.550 --> 39:09.670
and help his energy circulate.

39:09.670 --> 39:10.330
I'll handle

39:10.400 --> 39:10.930
the rest.

39:11.280 --> 39:11.840
Alright.

39:12.070 --> 39:12.960
Let me see

39:12.960 --> 39:14.110
your extraordinary acupuncture technique.

39:14.110 --> 39:14.710
Good.

39:53.630 --> 39:54.320
He's responding.

39:54.320 --> 39:55.920
Pierce his Shaoshang point.

40:04.710 --> 40:05.460
He moved.

40:05.550 --> 40:06.590
Press his Zuzhong point.

40:06.590 --> 40:07.400
I'll press on his upper body.

40:07.400 --> 40:08.860
Let's get his breath back.

40:09.230 --> 40:09.760
Come on.

40:35.320 --> 40:39.550
[Treatment Room]

40:43.930 --> 40:45.570
[Treatment Room]

40:46.070 --> 40:46.730
Elder Zhou,

40:46.960 --> 40:47.630
Lord Ling.

40:50.800 --> 40:51.670
How is...

40:53.260 --> 40:54.270
Feng Suige?

41:01.400 --> 41:02.460
He's not awake yet,

41:02.710 --> 41:04.110
but his life's no longer in danger.

41:04.110 --> 41:05.840
That brat Feng Suige won't die.

41:08.230 --> 41:10.070
He's been unconscious for too long.

41:10.070 --> 41:10.960
We'll have to wait until

41:10.960 --> 41:12.000
he wakes up to know

41:12.030 --> 41:13.230
his exact condition.

41:14.400 --> 41:15.490
No words can express my gratitude.

41:15.490 --> 41:16.720
[Treatment Room]

41:15.760 --> 41:17.020
Thank you, Elder Zhou.

41:18.150 --> 41:19.810
Thank you. You two are saints.

41:20.760 --> 41:22.420
Thank you. You two are saints.

41:22.670 --> 41:24.330
Thank you. You two are saints.

41:24.880 --> 41:25.480
Thank you.

41:26.920 --> 41:27.920
[Fuxin Pavilion]

41:38.110 --> 41:39.570
Greetings, Your Majesty.

41:41.110 --> 41:43.110
Your Majesty, why did you summon me?

41:44.000 --> 41:45.300
I heard that

41:45.510 --> 41:46.760
you dissolved your marriage

41:46.760 --> 41:49.220
with Prince of Zhennan without permission.

41:49.400 --> 41:50.200
That's right.

41:50.800 --> 41:51.840
This marriage

41:51.840 --> 41:53.920
concerns the politics of both our nations—

41:53.920 --> 41:56.190
it's not just a personal matter
between you two.

41:56.190 --> 41:57.670
You made such a decision

41:57.800 --> 41:59.320
without consulting me.

42:00.190 --> 42:02.120
Do you still respect my authority?

42:02.510 --> 42:04.110
The politics of two nations?

42:04.760 --> 42:05.800
At this point,

42:06.030 --> 42:07.440
does that still matter?

42:14.440 --> 42:16.630
I've heard about what happened
to your father and brother.

42:16.630 --> 42:17.630
The dead are gone.

42:18.030 --> 42:18.960
My condolences.

42:20.190 --> 42:21.450
Take care of yourself.

42:22.230 --> 42:22.920
When your brother

42:22.920 --> 42:24.920
Feng Chengyang ascends the throne,

42:25.230 --> 42:27.630
you'll become the Grand Princess of Susha,

42:27.710 --> 42:29.770
representing Susha's image abroad.

42:30.880 --> 42:32.230
It seems to you,

42:33.070 --> 42:34.400
who I am doesn't matter,

42:34.880 --> 42:35.630
nor does whether Prince of Zhennan

42:35.630 --> 42:37.360
and I get along.

42:37.710 --> 42:39.170
What matters is my status.

42:40.230 --> 42:41.440
You're a smart woman.

42:42.150 --> 42:43.880
I like talking to smart people.

42:44.800 --> 42:46.070
Your sudden misfortune

42:46.070 --> 42:47.440
made you lose your bearings,

42:47.440 --> 42:49.240
so I'll overlook your rashness.

42:49.550 --> 42:51.680
Go back, show humility, and apologize

42:51.710 --> 42:52.910
to Prince of Zhennan.

42:53.150 --> 42:55.210
You'll still be Princess of Zhennan.

42:55.630 --> 42:56.690
As long as you obey,

42:57.710 --> 42:59.670
I'm willing to be your protector.

43:01.480 --> 43:02.710
If I'm not mistaken,

43:03.510 --> 43:04.480
that's how you

43:04.480 --> 43:05.960
took advantage
of Xia Jingshi's weakness back then

43:05.960 --> 43:07.150
and gradually

43:07.150 --> 43:09.480
brought him under your control, isn't it?

43:09.710 --> 43:11.510
He's a man who knows how to adapt.

43:12.230 --> 43:13.480
I hope you are too.

43:13.960 --> 43:15.920
Then I'm afraid you'll be disappointed.

43:15.920 --> 43:16.590
I've always

43:17.280 --> 43:18.480
made a habit

43:18.480 --> 43:20.280
of taking control of my own fate.

43:20.710 --> 43:22.110
Marrying Xia Jingshi

43:22.110 --> 43:23.040
was my decision.

43:23.510 --> 43:24.760
Taking Xia Jingshi away from Susha

43:24.760 --> 43:25.920
was my decision.

43:26.320 --> 43:27.490
Divorcing him

43:28.070 --> 43:29.270
was also my decision.

43:29.760 --> 43:30.670
Since I've decided

43:30.670 --> 43:32.000
to cut all ties with him,

43:32.360 --> 43:33.800
even if it costs me my life,

43:33.800 --> 43:35.440
I'll never change my mind.

43:36.110 --> 43:37.920
I gave you a chance,

43:38.630 --> 43:39.760
but you refused it.

43:40.590 --> 43:42.400
Don't regret it later.

43:44.150 --> 43:46.480
Thank you for your kindness, Your Majesty.

43:46.480 --> 43:47.150
However,

43:48.280 --> 43:50.110
aside from my father and brother,

43:50.110 --> 43:52.000
I need no one's protection.

43:55.000 --> 43:56.110
I, Feng Xiyang,

43:56.840 --> 43:58.320
am my own protector.
